{
  "name": "actions-rewrite",
  "description": "S6. The actions a server returns to a serverAction fired inside a sub-page are rewritten with that sub-page's prefix before they run, by the same rules as the actions of a merged node. A server setState's `value` is walked like any Value: plain JSON is copied, and a map that is a page-state reference is rewritten. A reference with no `scope` is page-scoped. In a plugin (custom) action the references are rewritten and nested standard actions follow the rules, but its own literal fields (`key`, `stateKey`, `id`) are not known and stay. An entry of `components` that is not an object is left as it is. A static Value is data, with or without a `value`. addComponent and replaceComponent carry whole nodes, which are merged like the nodes of a page (ids, children, slot props, references, watches, actions). An updateComponent's `props` follow the prop rules, except that a slot cannot be recognised there.",
  "kind": "actions",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "state actions a server returns",
      "prefix": "detail:",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "count",
          "value": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "user",
          "value": {
            "name": "Ann",
            "roles": [
              "admin"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "app",
          "key": "cartCount",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "key": "implicit",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "clearState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "error"
        },
        {
          "type": "showSnackbar",
          "message": "Saved",
          "duration": 2000
        },
        {
          "type": "navigate",
          "route": "/home"
        },
        {
          "type": "closeDialog"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "detail:count",
          "value": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "detail:user",
          "value": {
            "name": "Ann",
            "roles": [
              "admin"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "scope": "app",
          "key": "cartCount",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "setState",
          "key": "detail:implicit",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "clearState",
          "scope": "page",
          "key": "detail:error"
        },
        {
          "type": "showSnackbar",
          "message": "Saved",
          "duration": 2000
        },
        {
          "type": "navigate",
          "route": "/home"
        },
        {
          "type": "closeDialog"
        }
      ]
    },
